Build candidate tool registry, dispatch, transforms, instructions and resource mappings as one immutable generation. Pin each call to one generation, with current grant revocation rechecks. Store active generation per user and avoid holding global locks during network work. Acceptance: concurrent calls never combine old schemas with new argument transforms; one user's preparation does not block unrelated user calls; failure leaves active generation unchanged.
